15
00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:57.000
Lecturer: Let's take the library example. The Member asks the Kiosk to borrow a book.

16
00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:05.000
Lecturer: The Kiosk asks the Catalogue whether the copy is available.

17
00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:13.000
Lecturer: The Catalogue answers yes, so the Kiosk asks the Loans service to create a loan.

18
00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:21.000
Lecturer: Notice the order of the arrows is exactly the order of the steps in the main flow.

